AccountV3Enrollment.verifyChange
├── given the current policy and a proposed active policy
│   ├── obtain authority only from current members and correct purpose/role
│   ├── require possession from each new descriptor or changed role/assistance
│   ├── unchanged members and removed members require no enrollment proof
│   ├── reject missing, duplicate, out-of-range, extra or unchanged-member proofs
│   └── reject downgrade to bootstrap or non-live authorization window
├── given valid old-authority signatures freshly generated for an altered proposal
│   └── reject old enrollment proofs after changes to nonce/version/account/policy/purpose/window/domain
└── given bootstrap promotion
    ├── require a real WebAuthn signature from the bootstrap key
    ├── require proof for its expanded roles and each new factor
    └── return consent only: storage nonce consumption, wait and commit remain the account's responsibility
